          <div class="i_about__text">
            <h2 class="i_about__title">About Nisshinbo Micro Devices Inc.</h2>
            <p>Nisshinbo Micro Devices Inc. is the result of an integration former New Japan Radio Co., Ltd. and former RICOH Electronic Devices Co., Ltd. <br>
              New Japan Radio Co., Ltd as famous as Op-amp supplier and RICOH Electronic Devices as known as Power management IC supplier  integrated. We further grow as an "Analog solution provider".</p>
            <div class="i_about__button"> <a class="c_button c_button--primary c_button--liquid" href="/en/about/hayawakari/"><span class="c_button__arrow">At a Glance <br class="u_isSp">
              Nisshinbo Micro Devices Inc.</span></a> </div>
          </div>
          <div class="i_about__image"> <img class="u_isPc" src="/en/images/pc/pic_about_01.jpg" alt="We contribute to realizing a smart society through [Connect Everything] technology that connect Humans to Humans, Things to Humans and Things to Things."> <img class="u_isSp" src="/en/images/sp/pic_about_01.jpg" alt="We contribute to realizing a smart society through [Connect Everything] technology that connect Humans to Humans, Things to Humans and Things to Things."> </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
